cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "complex-terrain-verif: station verification of open AI weather forecasts in complex terrain"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the works it builds on (see docs/RELATED_WORK.md)."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pagaran
    given-names: Joseph Ambrose
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7595-9070"
abstract: >-
  Station verification of open AI weather forecasts in complex terrain, across an Alpine
  and a Nordic domain. Begun on 7 September 2026 as a single-domain Norwegian prototype
  (version 0.1.0) and widened to two domains, a read-only service and the present
  documentation on 31 October 2026 (version 0.2.0).
version: 0.2.0
